# ==============================================================================
#  💡 CRITICAL NOTES FOR SWITCHING:
# ==============================================================================
# 1. The app reads the .env file ONLY when it starts. You MUST restart Expo 
#    (`npx expo start -c`) after changing this file for the changes to take effect.
# 2. Local data (Local DB): Users, products, and orders are separate from remote.
#    When you switch to Remote, you will see your old live data.
# 3. When switching back to Local, you will need to sign up a new user again
#    because local databases are sandboxed and empty.
# 4. The "10.0.2.2" IP in LOCAL is specifically for Android emulators. 
#    If you ever test on iOS, change it to "127.0.0.1".